WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Orion Group controls the far shore.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.575
A straight assault will leave your force stranded between land and sea.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:18.175
Build the branches of your command together: reconnaissance above, mechanized forces ashore, and naval cover along the crossing.

00:00:18.175 --> 00:00:23.800
The first operation is a lesson in making the whole army matter.
